        <activityName xml:lang="en">Pump 40W, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Pump 40W, at plant
Water pump Grundfos UP 15-35x20 with a capacity of 40W for use in solar collector systems.;
UUID: 9f179890-9d25-3b90-976f-05ea73c2346e
Production and disposal of a water pump. Including materials. Not including energy use of production and infrastructure for factory.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Circulating pump for heat exchange fluid in solar collector systems for a one family dwelling.
Time period: Time of weighting the different parts of the pump.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Own weighting of the different parts of  the pump. 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9f179890-9d25-3b90-976f-05ea73c2346e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
